rre_et_Marie_Curie_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nobel_Pierre_et_Marie_Curie_1.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Diploma of Nobel Prize in Physics, awarded in december 1903 to Pierre and Marie Curie. Both shared this distinction with Henri Becquerel, whose name is mentioned on the document."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1903-12-10"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Sofia_Gisberg\" title=\"Category:Sofia Gisberg\">Sofia Gisberg</a>, uploaded and retouched by <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Jebulon\" title=\"User:Jebulon\">Jebulon</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain"}}}]},{"pageid":79936661,"title":"File:Noctilucent-clouds-msu-6817.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c5/Noctilucent-clouds-msu-6817.jpg/960px-Noctilucent-clouds-msu-6817.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Noctilucent-clouds-msu-6817.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Noctilucent_cloud\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Noctilucent cloud\">Noctilucent clouds</a> in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laboe\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Laboe\">Laboe</a>, Germany"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2019-06-21"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q59087075\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q59087075\"><span title=\"German Journalist and trainer\">Matthias Süßen</span></a></bdi>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":96250713,"title":"File:Noctua pronuba caterpillar - Keila.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Noctua_pronuba_caterpillar_-_Keila.jpg/960px-Noctua_pronuba_caterpillar_-_Keila.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Noctua_pronuba_caterpillar_-_Keila.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Large yellow underwing (<i>Noctua pronuba</i>) caterpillar. Length 37 mm. Keila, Northwestern Estonia"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2020-11-18"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Iifar\" title=\"User:Iifar\">Ivar Leidus</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":97051951,"title":"File:Noctua pronuba caterpillar defensive - Keila.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Noctua_pronuba_caterpillar_defensive_-_Keila.jpg/960px-Noctua_pronuba_caterpillar_defensive_-_Keila.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Noctua_pronuba_caterpillar_defensive_-_Keila.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Large yellow underwing (<i>Noctua pronuba</i>) caterpillar (length 37 mm) in defensive posture. Keila, Northwestern Estonia"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2020-11-22"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Iifar\" title=\"User:Iifar\">Ivar Leidus</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":103764866,"title":"File:NohKaLikai Falls V2 Wiki.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/NohKaLikai_Falls_V2_Wiki.jpg/960px-NohKaLikai_Falls_V2_Wiki.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NohKaLikai_Falls_V2_Wiki.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Nohkalikai Falls is the tallest plunge waterfall in India. Its height is 340 metres (1,115 ft). The waterfall is located in the Indian state of Meghalaya, near Cherrapunji, one of the wettest places on Earth. Nohkalikai Falls are fed by the rainwater collected on the summit of a comparatively small plateau and decrease in power during the dry season, from December to February. Below the falls is a plunge pool with unusual green-colored water. \nCapturing Team- Dr Vikramjit Kakati - Photogrammetry, Mr Arpan Uzir – Navigation &amp; Equipment Support, Mr Himadri Bhuyan – Logistics Support,Mr Dheeman Garg – METEOROLOGICAL Support, Inspired by – CANON India"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2021-04-16"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Donvikro\" title=\"User:Donvikro\">Vikramjit Kakati</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":112744733,"title":"File:Nokia Arena November 2021 5.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/Nokia_Arena_November_2021_5.jpg/960px-Nokia_Arena_November_2021_5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nokia_Arena_November_2021_5.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Nokia Arena in November 2021."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2021-11-22 11:51"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Kallerna\" title=\"User:Kallerna\">kallerna</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":113378712,"title":"File:Non-Biting Diptera Midge Larva.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Non-Biting_Diptera_Midge_Larva.jpg/960px-Non-Biting_Diptera_Midge_Larva.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Non-Biting_Diptera_Midge_Larva.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"This image is of an unidentified species of diptera (midge) larva, possibly a non-biting diptera midge. The image is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/focus_stacking\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:focus stacking\">focus stacked</a> panorama captured in darkfield + compensated polarized light microscopy. In <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/plane_polarized\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:plane polarized\">plane polarized</a> light, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birefringence\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Birefringence\">birefringent</a> muscle tissues within the body of the creature appear to glow in varying colours that depend on the fiber density and their orientations with respect to the optical axis of the microscope. The colors are derived from the insertion of a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/waveplate\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:waveplate\">waveplate</a> in the optical path of the microscope."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2021-11-01 22:09:08"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=User:KarlGaff&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:KarlGaff (page does not exist)\">KarlGaff</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofsciencephotography.com\">Art of Science Photography</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":121605255,"title":"File:Nomfusi in Munich 2022 07.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Nomfusi_in_Munich_2022_07.jpg/960px-Nomfusi_in_Munich_2022_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nomfusi_in_Munich_2022_07.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Nomfusi at a concert organized by Global Grooves in the courtyard of Blutenburg castle, Munich, Germany 2022"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2022-08-10 20:25:31"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Kritzolina\" title=\"User:Kritzolina\">Kritzolina</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":132564127,"title":"File:Nogueira valley view from Balcões, São Roque do Faial, Santana, Madeira, 2023 May.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Nogueira_valley_view_from_Balc%C3%B5es%2C_S%C3%A3o_Roque_do_Faial%2C_Santana%2C_Madeira%2C_2023_May.jpg/960px-Nogueira_valley_view_from_Balc%C3%B5es%2C_S%C3%A3o_Roque_do_Faial%2C_Santana%2C_Madeira%2C_2023_May.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Nogueira_valley_view_from_Balc%C3%B5es,_S%C3%A3o_Roque_do_Faial,_Santana,_Madeira,_2023_May.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Nogueira valley view from Balcões in São Roque do Faial, Santana, Madeira, Portugal in 2023 May."},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2023-05-27"},"Artist":{"value":"<a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Ximonic\" title=\"User:Ximonic\">Ximonic</a> (Simo Räsänen)"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]},{"pageid":156091593,"title":"File:Noctua fimbriata (caterpillar) focus stacking-20241118-RM-211015.jpg","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Noctua_fimbriata_%28caterpillar%29_focus_stacking-20241118-RM-211015.jpg/960px-Noctua_fimbriata_%28caterpillar%29_focus_stacking-20241118-RM-211015.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Noctua_fimbriata_(caterpillar)_focus_stacking-20241118-RM-211015.jpg","extmetadata":{"ImageDescription":{"value":"Caterpillar of the variegated banded owl (Noctua fimbriata) on a Muehlenbeckia"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2024-11-18"},"Artist":{"value":"Reinhold Möller <a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Ermell\" title=\"User:Ermell\">Ermell</a>"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}}}]}]}}